WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a low lunge, straighten the front leg and shift the hips back.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Flex the front foot and hinge forward with a flat back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hands frame the front leg or rest on blocks.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the hips square.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
